# Nothing secret is needed to build or run this app.
#
# The GitHub token is supplied in the browser on first visit and stored only in
# that browser, because GitHub Pages cannot keep a secret. See the README.
#
# Optional: point the app at a different data repo. Defaults to the value in
# next.config.js. This is not a secret - it only names the repo.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GITHUB_DATA_REPO=your-username/good-kid-score-data
